<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $51 (FIM 231.79).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $51 (FIM 231.79).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR</p>
<p>closed down $0-3/4 at $51 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 231.79 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki on Tuesday Nokia A closed two markka lower at 230.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/8</p>
<p>31-7/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 72.43 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 73.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-1/4 at $18-7/8 in</p>
<p>New York on Tuesday. The price equals about 85.80 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki, Rauma closed up 2.50 markka at 88.00.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
